  "caveats": [
    "Not official VBench Total. Speedups are same-machine FULL50 / (stage1 + post) per group.",
    "Stage-to-stage frames pass through a lossless uint8 file because the two stages use different Python environments; file I/O and MP4 encoding are excluded from timing.",
    "F41 arms play 41 generated frames as 81 at 16 fps, i.e. 2x slow motion of what Wan drew; flow-based freeze/motion metrics must be normalized for this before comparison with FULL50.",
    "LR81 is generated at 416x240, outside Wan2.1-1.3B's 480p training canvas; LR_BICUBIC separates low-resolution generation failures from SR failures."
  ]
